      "name": "Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites)",
      "steam_appid": 1156250,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Named <u>one of the best VR horror experiences available</u> by <i>UploadVR, this is the</i> Deluxe Complete Series with enhanced graphics &amp; animations, upgraded movement controls and Index controller support.  Just keep telling yourself &quot;it's only VR&quot;.  Get it now before Steam Frame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note the supported headsets for best results.  If you own a Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Pico 4,  etc. please purchase from the respective stores as those control schemes are not officially supported.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) features support for tracked controllers,  “teleport&quot; and “free roam” locomotion options, and a variety of other highly customizable movement settings accessed via your in-game mobile phone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, sinister and completely immersive environments hide rich story clues and a variety of unique secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use a several trademark exorcism tools as well as hidden “artifacts” to upgrade your instruments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive cryptic messages from a mysterious stranger who seems to know your every move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the safety of your office at the end of every chapter to assess your performance and progress to the subsequent chapter. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.poster.avif?t=1770652249\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.webm?t=1770652249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.mp4?t=1770652249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
      "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Named <u>one of the best VR horror experiences available</u> by <i>UploadVR, this is the</i> Deluxe Complete Series with enhanced graphics &amp; animations, upgraded movement controls and Index controller support.  Just keep telling yourself &quot;it's only VR&quot;.  Get it now before Steam Frame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note the supported headsets for best results.  If you own a Quest 2, Quest Pro, Quest 3, Pico 4,  etc. please purchase from the respective stores as those control schemes are not officially supported.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) features support for tracked controllers,  “teleport&quot; and “free roam” locomotion options, and a variety of other highly customizable movement settings accessed via your in-game mobile phone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic, sinister and completely immersive environments hide rich story clues and a variety of unique secrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use a several trademark exorcism tools as well as hidden “artifacts” to upgrade your instruments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive cryptic messages from a mysterious stranger who seems to know your every move. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the safety of your office at the end of every chapter to assess your performance and progress to the subsequent chapter. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.poster.avif?t=1770652249\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.webm?t=1770652249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/extras/f81f4d9f4c4614a1e868dcadc7995838.mp4?t=1770652249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
      "short_description": "Exorcism of the Legion (Last Rites) is a complete collection of all FIVE chapters of the acclaimed VR experience. Investigate and exorcise sinister demonic entities as you make your way to a final confrontation with your darkest fears.",
      "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
      "reviews": "“If you’re looking for an incredibly intense horror experience that will likely elicit screams and whimpers of fear, you can’t go wrong with The Exorcist: Legion VR.”<br>Kotaku<br><br>“Brilliant - and we never want to look at it again”<br>VRFocus<br><br>“It’s a terrifying psychological trip that blends the creep factor of The Exorcist with immersive VR gameplay to make a terrifying adventure that’s a must play for anyone that considers themselves a fan of horror.”<br>GameCrate<br>",
      "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1156250/2769e076da1827215e3754e7a08b03e072927a22/header.jpg?t=1770652249",
